  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-article-paragraph\" data-analytics-module=\"{\n            &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Paragraph&quot;,\n            &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;Introducing Vertical Video Unification with Display \\u0026 Video 360.&quot;\n          }\">\n   <uni-article-paragraph class=\"uni-article-paragraph__container uni-grid__col--layout-6\">\n    <div class=\"rich-text\">\n     <p data-block-key=\"gpa7i\">Audiences today discover brands and purchase products across a wide range of formats, including vertical video. As customer journeys span so many touchpoints, advertisers need a smart platform that unifies media buying and ads that deliver the best ROI.</p>\n     <p data-block-key=\"in2o\">We’re introducing Vertical Video Unification with Google Display &amp; Video 360, making it possible to buy and measure vertical video programmatically across channels in one platform. This new solution centralizes vertical video buys from publishers across vertical video into a single workstream.</p>\n     <p data-block-key=\"5j24k\">And with Gemini powering buying, execution, and full-funnel measurement, Display &amp; Video 360 delivers competitive campaign performance without overexposing users to the same ads — benefits that siloed buying strategies can’t replicate.</p>\n     <p data-block-key=\"bs00c\">During initial testing, Unilever’s Hellmann’s and WPP Media achieved a 24% increase in unique reach while reducing cost per unique user by 25%.</p>\n    </div>\n    <!---->\n   </uni-article-paragraph>\n  </section>\n  <div class=\"block-media_carousel\">\n   <section class=\"uni-page--fullbleed uni-media-carousel-wrapper\" data-analytics-module=\"{\n    &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Media Carousel&quot;,\n    &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;Introducing Vertical Video Unification with Display \\u0026 Video 360.&quot;\n  }\">\n    <uni-media-carousel class=\"uni-media-carousel uni-page uni-grid\" data-shape-context-provider=\"\">\n     <!---->\n     <div class=\"uni-carousel\" role=\"region\" aria-roledescription=\"carousel\" aria-label=\"Carousel\">\n      <!--?lit$6478069067$-->\n      <uni-media-carousel-viewport slot=\"viewport\" class=\"uni-media-carousel__viewport\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"display: block;\">\n       <!---->\n       <div class=\"uni-scrollable-cards-panel-viewport\">\n        <div class=\"uni-scrollable-cards-panel-viewport__container\" role=\"list\" style=\"inset-inline-start: -524.5px; padding-inline: 524.5px 319.5px; scroll-padding-inline: 524.5px 319.5px;\">\n         <!--?lit$6478069067$-->\n         <!---->\n         <div class=\"uni-scrollable-cards-panel-viewport__slide\" role=\"listitem\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\">\n          <!--?lit$6478069067$-->\n          <uni-media-carousel-slide class=\"uni-media-carousel__slide\" data-theme=\"green\" shapes=\"[&quot;6-sided-cookie&quot;, &quot;8-leaf-clover&quot;, &quot;square&quot;]\" data-index=\"0\" accordion-header=\"\">\n           <!---->\n           <!--?lit$6478069067$-->\n           <div class=\"uni-media-carousel__content\">\n            <!--?lit$6478069067$-->\n            <!--?lit$6478069067$-->\n            <div slot=\"content\" style=\"display: block;\">\n             <uni-media data-analytics-module=\"{\n    &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Media Carousel/Image&quot;,\n    &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;Introducing Vertical Video Unification with Display \\u0026amp\\u003B Video 360.&quot;\n  }\" or-mp4-video-url=\"\" section-header=\"Introducing Vertical Video Unification with Display &amp; Video 360.\" alt-text=\"Text reading: &quot;Vertical video integration&quot; sits above the Google Display &amp; Video 360 logo. To the right, a white smartphone-shaped card glows at the edges, standing in front of a layered stack of vertical video previews.\" video-title=\"\" autoplay=\"true\">\n              <!---->\n              <div class=\"uni-media\">\n               <!--?lit$6478069067$-->\n               <div class=\" uni-media__asset \">\n                <!--?lit$6478069067$-->\n                <div slot=\"image-slot\" style=\"display: block;\">\n                 <img alt=\"Text reading: &quot;Vertical video integration&quot; sits above the Google Display &amp; Video 360 logo. To the right, a white smartphone-shaped card glows at the edges, standing in front of a layered stack of vertical video previews.\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/01_Blog_-_Header.width-100.format-webp.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" data-loading=\"{\n            &quot;mobile&quot;: &quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/01_Blog_-_Header.width-500.format-webp.webp&quot;,\n            &quot;desktop&quot;: &quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/01_Blog_-_Header.width-1000.format-webp.webp&quot;\n          }\">\n                </div>\n                <!--?lit$6478069067$-->\n                <!--?lit$6478069067$-->\n                <!--?-->\n               </div>\n              </div>\n             </uni-media>\n            </div>\n           </div>\n           <!--?lit$6478069067$-->\n           <!--?-->\n          </uni-media-carousel-slide>\n         </div>\n         <!---->\n         <!---->\n         <div class=\"uni-scrollable-cards-panel-viewport__slide\" role=\"listitem\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\">\n          <!--?lit$6478069067$-->\n          <uni-media-carousel-slide class=\"uni-media-carousel__slide\" data-theme=\"green\" shapes=\"[&quot;6-sided-cookie&quot;, &quot;8-leaf-clover&quot;, &quot;square&quot;]\" data-index=\"1\" accordion-header=\"\">\n           <!---->\n           <!--?lit$6478069067$-->\n           <div class=\"uni-media-carousel__content\">\n            <!--?lit$6478069067$-->\n            <!--?lit$6478069067$-->\n            <div slot=\"content\" style=\"display: block;\">\n             <uni-media data-analytics-module=\"{\n    &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Media Carousel/Image&quot;,\n    &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;Introducing Vertical Video Unification with Display \\u0026amp\\u003B Video 360.&quot;\n  }\" or-mp4-video-url=\"\" section-header=\"Introducing Vertical Video Unification with Display &amp; Video 360.\" alt-text=\"Quote from Melissa Sheehy, Unilever\" video-title=\"\" autoplay=\"true\">\n              <!---->\n              <div class=\"uni-media\">\n               <!--?lit$6478069067$-->\n               <div class=\" uni-media__asset \">\n                <!--?lit$6478069067$-->\n                <div slot=\"image-slot\" style=\"display: block;\">\n                 <img alt=\"Quote from Melissa Sheehy, Unilever\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/04_Blog_-_Quote_1.width-100.format-webp.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" data-loading=\"{\n            &quot;mobile&quot;: &quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/04_Blog_-_Quote_1.width-500.format-webp.webp&quot;,\n            &quot;desktop&quot;: &quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/04_Blog_-_Quote_1.width-1000.format-webp.webp&quot;\n          }\">\n                </div>\n                <!--?lit$6478069067$-->\n                <!--?lit$6478069067$-->\n                <!--?-->\n               </div>\n              </div>\n             </uni-media>\n            </div>\n           </div>\n           <!--?lit$6478069067$-->\n           <!--?-->\n          </uni-media-carousel-slide>\n         </div>\n         <!---->\n         <!---->\n         <div class=\"uni-scrollable-cards-panel-viewport__slide\" role=\"listitem\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\">\n          <!--?lit$6478069067$-->\n          <uni-media-carousel-slide class=\"uni-media-carousel__slide\" data-theme=\"green\" shapes=\"[&quot;6-sided-cookie&quot;, &quot;8-leaf-clover&quot;, &quot;square&quot;]\" data-index=\"2\" accordion-header=\"\">\n           <!---->\n           <!--?lit$6478069067$-->\n           <div class=\"uni-media-carousel__content\">\n            <!--?lit$6478069067$-->\n            <!--?lit$6478069067$-->\n            <div slot=\"content\" style=\"display: block;\">\n             <uni-media data-analytics-module=\"{\n    &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Media Carousel/Image&quot;,\n    &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;Introducing Vertical Video Unification with Display \\u0026amp\\u003B Video 360.&quot;\n  }\" or-mp4-video-url=\"\" section-header=\"Introducing Vertical Video Unification with Display &amp; Video 360.\" alt-text=\"Quote from Ronen Benatar, WPP Media U.S\" video-title=\"\" autoplay=\"true\">\n              <!---->\n              <div class=\"uni-media\">\n               <!--?lit$6478069067$-->\n               <div class=\" uni-media__asset \">\n                <!--?lit$6478069067$-->\n                <div slot=\"image-slot\" style=\"display: block;\">\n                 <img alt=\"Quote from Ronen Benatar, WPP Media U.S\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/05_Blog_-_Quote_2.width-100.format-webp.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" data-loading=\"{\n            &quot;mobile&quot;: &quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/05_Blog_-_Quote_2.width-500.format-webp.webp&quot;,\n            &quot;desktop&quot;: &quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/05_Blog_-_Quote_2.width-1000.format-webp.webp&quot;\n          }\">\n                </div>\n                <!--?lit$6478069067$-->\n                <!--?lit$6478069067$-->\n                <!--?-->\n               </div>\n              </div>\n             </uni-media>\n            </div>\n           </div>\n           <!--?lit$6478069067$-->\n           <!--?-->\n          </uni-media-carousel-slide>\n         </div>\n         <!---->\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </uni-media-carousel-viewport>\n      <!--?lit$6478069067$-->\n      <div slot=\"controls\" style=\"display: block;\">\n       <div class=\"uni-media-carousel__controls-container\">\n        <uni-carousel-controls class=\"uni-media-carousel__controls\">\n         <!---->\n         <div class=\"uni-carousel-controls\">\n          <div class=\"uni-carousel-controls__arrows\">\n           <button class=\"uni-carousel-controls__btn uni-carousel-controls__btn--prev\" aria-label=\"Previous item\" disabled>\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n             <path d=\"M15.41 16.59L10.83 12L15.41 7.41L14 6L8 12L14 18L15.41 16.59Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path>\n            </svg>\n           </button>\n           <button class=\"uni-carousel-controls__btn uni-carousel-controls__btn--next\" aria-label=\"Next item\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n             <path d=\"M8.59 16.59L13.17 12L8.59 7.41L10 6L16 12L10 18L8.59 16.59Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path>\n            </svg>\n           </button>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"uni-carousel-controls__progress-wrapper\">\n           <div class=\"uni-carousel-controls__progress-bar\"></div>\n          </div>\n         </div>\n        </uni-carousel-controls>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </uni-media-carousel>\n   </section>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "Google 在 Display & Video 360 中推出垂直视频统一功能，借助 Gemini 实现跨垂直视频渠道的程序化购买与测量集中化，初步测试显示覆盖范围提升且成本降低。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "Google 在 Display & Video 360 中推出垂直视频统一功能，借助 Gemini 实现跨垂直视频渠道的程序化购买与测量集中化，初步测试显示覆盖范围提升且成本降低。",
  "summary": "Google 在其 Display & Video 360 平台内推出了名为「垂直视频统一」的新功能。该解决方案允许广告主通过单一界面，跨多个发布商和渠道以程序化方式购买并测量垂直视频广告。由 Gemini AI 提供支持，该工具旨在优化营销活动表现和全漏斗测量，同时防止广告疲劳。来自 Unilever 和 WPP Media 等合作伙伴的早期测试数据显示，与分散式购买策略相比，独立用户触达率提高了 24%，每位独立用户的成本降低了 25%。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "垂直视频统一功能实现了垂直视频广告程序化购买与测量的集中化。",
      "explanation": "Display & Video 360 中的这一新功能将来自多个发布商的垂直视频购买整合到单一工作流中，解决了受众触点碎片化的问题。"
    },
    {
      "point": "Gemini AI 为购买、执行和测量流程提供动力。",
      "explanation": "通过集成 Gemini，该平台旨在提供具有竞争力的营销活动表现和全漏斗洞察，同时避免让用户过度接触重复广告，这在采用分散策略时难以实现。"
    },
    {
      "point": "初步测试显示主要广告主的效率显著提升。",
      "explanation": "来自 Unilever 旗下 Hellmann's 品牌和 WPP Media 的数据表明，在试点阶段，独立用户触达率提高了 24%，每位独立用户的成本降低了 25%。"
    }
  ],
  "keyQuotes": [
    "我们在 Google Display & Video 360 中推出了垂直视频统一功能，使得在一个平台上跨渠道程序化购买和测量垂直视频成为可能。",
    "在初步测试期间，Unilever 旗下的 Hellmann's 和 WPP Media 实现了独立用户触达率提高 24%，同时将每位独立用户的成本降低了 25%。"
  ],
